  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mobility  Devices  for children with special needs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Parents of children have 3 questions 1.When will my child talk? 2.When will my child walk? 3 After me who will take care? APD is constantly engaged to find answers and rehabilitate these children with special need to be functionally independent. APD thus believes in the philosophy of EQUIP, ENABLE &amp; EMPOWER By providing the right type of mobility aids such as personalized  Ankle Foot Orthosis, walkers, crutches, wheelchairs, hearing aids, commodes, rollators  we are able to make their lives easy</narrative>
  </description>
